  "_doc": "ICW-05c look round (plan rev. 2, Fable 2026-11-05 18:00 UTC; the creator's reference sheet of 17:54 UTC: 'like this, but less 3D'). Ten spots on a slider from the reference's stylized 3D (slider 1) to a flat painting of it (slider 10), every knob independent (style.Look): a blend is one more entry. Rendered by style_sheets looks on the EEVEE light path; cast shadows only where a variant says so (cinematic rig, or the flat cast-shadow shape), their cost measured. No variant is chosen: the creator picks, then ICW-07 writes the bible v1.5 style block. Ramp positions are the key light's N.L (key energy 1 in these graphs), tones are light multipliers. The swatch twins (suffix _swatch) are variants 1, 5 and 9 with the reference sheet's six swatches as their palette map.",
